# The TLS private key.
#
# The runtime stage only copies ./dist, so the key never reached the published
# image — but `COPY . .` in the build stage put it in an intermediate layer,
# which is a private key sitting in the build cache and in anything derived
# from that stage. The Dockerfile says in as many words that the key must not
# become an image layer; this is what makes that true.
cert

# multer stages uploads here on their way to Cloudinary. Whatever happens to be
# mid-flight when an image is built is not part of the image.
temp
